1. R and C++ agree with the conveyor on, in every config ('test-conveyor.R:215:5') - window starts at 1960 with 179.8 GtC of land-use carbon already emitted, so the land's equilibrium is 8.4 % below preindustrial at the first step while ccx_spinup() supplies preindustrial stocks. Expect a start-up transient. Start at the beginning of the emissions record, or spin up against the cleared land yourself.

